    "https://uzhcareer.ch/de/jobs/detail/?id=59c9b609-39c6-f111-9b60-9e890cc6b0ac&slug=intern---financial-services-audit---geneva-january-2027-june-2027": {
      "title": "Intern - Financial Services Audit - Geneva (January 2027 – June 2027)",
      "description": "Intern - Financial Services Audit - Geneva (January 2027 – June 2027) Deloitte 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Westschweiz & Wallis Beschreibung Facebook Twitter LinkedIn of 2 100% Rotate Clockwise Rotate Counterclockwise Switch Orientation First Page Last Page Reset Zoom Print Document Download Document View Metadata Draw Job Name Intern - Financial Services Audit - Geneva ( January 2027 – June 202 7 ) Job Description Entry 1 Location : Geneva Work Pattern Percentage : 80 - 100% Start date : January 2027 You bring the ambition, we provide opportunities. As the world changes, businesses must be ready to respond to the challenges and opportunities that lie ahead. In Deloitte Audit & Assurance we protect the public interest and build trust in business by delivering leading assurance and living a culture that empowers people to thrive. In close collaboration with our professionals, you conduct audit and assurance missions with diverse, major organisations. You work independently while benefiting from the expert advice of experienced colleagues. Your active contribution is pivotal, as you engage in shaping the future of our offerings and nurture your own professional growth. How you can make an impact Gain insight into how financial services organizations operate and the economic and industry challenges they are facing Drive effective and reliable financial and non - financial reporting as a forward - looking auditor with in - depth business process and internal controls understanding Think differently and identify actionable measures for improved stability Develop people early on in your career and build a broad professional network Bring your fresh ideas and pioneering thinking to the forefront early in your career at Deloitte Go a clear, long - term career path and receive first - class training for your professional development, including support to qualify as Swiss certified public accountant (Swiss CPA). (Expert(e) - comptable diplômé(e) – EXPERTsuisse) What you bring to succeed You come with a bachelor’s or master’s degree in Economics (ideally with a specialization in Accounting, Banking, Finance, or Controlling) You have excellent analytical competencies and are interested in understanding the world of banking and finance You enjoy solving complex challenges in a team and are interested in innovation and transformation (including but not limited to data analytics) You are keen to learn and to complete further education to become a Swiss CPA at EXPERTsuisse You are fluent in French and English, German or Italian are a plus You are curious and courageous Your team Become part of a diverse, multinational and highly motivated team at our Geneva office. We will help you grow both personally and professionally: through our trainings, mentoring programmes and on - the - job learning, but also by connecting with your colleagues across all business lines. In the audit and assurance team, we believe in a common purpose where we help to protect public interest and trust in business, and we provide independent assurance for organizations to make the right decisions. You bring ambition, we provide opportunities. We support our people to be their authentic selves, and we recognize the collective strength of our diverse backgrounds. Additionally, we support each other and embrace change together as a team and lastly, we provide a unique and inspiring development journey to augment skills and capabilities you need now and, in the future. Meet our people Want to learn more about what it's really like to work at Deloitte? Hear directly from our colleagues in Audit & Assurance, how they experience their career and continuous growth: Take off into a career without limits A&A Reverse Mentoring Programme Benefits for you We believe in more than just work – we're committed to creating meaningful, inclusive experiences where you can thrive, both personally and professionally. From flexible working arrangements and continuous learning to comprehensive well - being support and opportunities to make a social impact, we invest in helping you grow. Explore our full benefits package here Careers at Deloitte At Deloitte, your ideas create impact and spark meaningful change for our clients, people and society. Your unique expertise, background, and perspective help us find new ways into the most complex challenges so we can brighten the futures of those our work affects. With more than 460’000 employees globally, Deloitte is the largest professional services firm in the world, with offices in more than 150 countries. In Switzerland, we provide a wide range of integrated services in the areas of Audit & Assurance, Tax & Legal, Strategy, Risk & Transactions, and Technology & Transformation. With around 2,500 employees at six locations, we serve companies and organisations of all sizes in every industry sector. Experience endless opportunities for professional growth, where you can bring in your entrepreneurial spirit while advising top - tier organizations on cutting - edge interdisciplinary projects within a global environment. Join a collaborative culture where you can work flexibly alongside talented, inspiring colleagues from over 70 nationalities. We are looking for people who approach challenges with curiosity and flexibility; bring a collaborative mindset and a can - do attitude; and wish to grow their career in a dynamic and fast - paced environment. Together makes progress. Want to know more about opportunities at Deloitte? Visit www.apply.deloitte.ch How to apply Stelle anzeigen Publikationsdatum 12.10.2026 Arbeitspensum (%) 100% Branche Banken / Finanzinstitute Funktionsbereich Beratung, Planung & Strategie Stellenantritt Nach Vereinbarung Arbeitsort Rue du Pré de la Bichette 1 1202 Geneva Schweiz Kontaktinformationen Frau Emilia Seppaenen 058 279 7796 E-Mail Pfingstweidstrasse 11 8005 Zürich Weitere Jobs Deloitte Intern – Accounting & Reporting Assurance (February 2027 – July 2027) Deloitte 08.10.2026 80% Praktikum Schweiz Deloitte Intern - LSE/SME - Audit & Assurance (October 2027 – June 2028) Deloitte 07.10.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Deloitte Career Start: Analyst - Financial Services Audit - Geneva (October 2027) Deloitte 01.10.2026 100% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz Deloitte Career Start: Analyst - Financial Services Audit - Zurich/Basel (October 2027) Deloitte 01.10.2026 100% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Deloitte Intern - Financial Services Audit - Geneva (October 2027 – March 2028) Deloitte 01.10.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz Deloitte Intern - Financial Services Audit - Zurich/Basel (October 2027 – March 2028) Deloitte 01.10.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Deloitte Career Start: Analyst - Large & Complex Audit - Zurich, Basel & Bern (Start October 2027) (24995) Deloitte 01.10.2026 80% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz Deloitte Intern - Large & Complex Audit - Zurich, Basel & Bern (October 2027 - March 2028) 24996 Deloitte 01.10.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Deloitte Trainee – M&A Transaction Services 24053 Deloitte 28.09.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Deloitte Trainee M&A Advisory – Corporate Finance 25204 Deloitte 22.09.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen"
