    "https://uzhcareer.ch/de/jobs/detail/?id=ddd80535-69c2-f111-9b5f-8fb21db7f411&slug=-intern-accounting-reporting-assurance-february-2027-july-2027": {
      "title": "Intern – Accounting & Reporting Assurance (February 2027 – July 2027)",
      "description": "Intern – Accounting & Reporting Assurance (February 2027 – July 2027) Deloitte 80% Praktikum Schweiz Beschreibung Facebook Twitter LinkedIn of 3 100% Rotate Clockwise Rotate Counterclockwise Switch Orientation First Page Last Page Reset Zoom Print Document Download Document View Metadata Draw Job Title: Intern – Accounting & Reporting – Audit & Assurance (February 2027 – July 2027) Location: Zurich Work Pattern Percentage: 80 - 100% Start date: February 2027 You bring ambition, we provide opportunities. As the world changes, businesses must be ready to respond to the challenges and opportunities that lie ahead. In Deloitte Audit & Assurance we protect the public interest and build trust in business by delivering leading assurance and living a culture that empowers people to thrive. As an Intern in our Assurance practice, you will gain hands - on experience working with leading companies across industries. You will support our teams in delivering high - quality services, while being exposed to advisory engagements to assist client with their reporting requirements and internal control framework. You work independently while benefiting from the expert advice of experienced colleagues. Your active contribution is pivotal, as you engage in shaping the future of our offerings and nurture your own professional growth. How you can make an impact • Gain insight into how organizations operate and the economic and industry challenges they are facing • Develop an understanding of accounting, auditing, internal control, reporting and regulatory frameworks • Support assurance projects delivering on their offerings, including for example, GAAP conversions, preparation of financial statements, monthly closing, management reporting and internal controls documentation • Work collaboratively with teams from other service lines to deliver insights and recommendations to clients • Develop people early on in your career and build a broad professional network • Bring your fresh ideas and pioneering thinking to the forefront early in your career at Deloitte • Go a clear, long - term career path and receive first - class training for your professional development, including support to qualify as Swiss certified public accountant (Swiss CPA) ( https://www.expertsuisse.ch/ausbildung ) What you bring to succeed • You are a curious, well - organized and empathetic problem solver with the ability to explain complex technical issues to a business audience in a relatable and understandable way • You are confident using digital tools and quick to adopt new technologies that help you work effectively Publikationsdatum 08.10.2026 Arbeitspensum (%) 80% Branche Banken / Finanzinstitute Funktionsbereich Rechnungswesen & Controlling Stellenantritt 01.02.2027 Arbeitsort Pfingstweidstrasse 11 8005 Zürich Schweiz Kontaktinformationen Frau Emilia Seppaenen E-Mail Pfingstweidstrasse 11 8005 Zürich Weitere Jobs Deloitte Intern - Financial Services Audit - Geneva (January 2027 – June 2027) Deloitte 12.10.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Westschweiz & Wallis Deloitte Intern - LSE/SME - Audit & Assurance (October 2027 – June 2028) Deloitte 07.10.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Deloitte Career Start: Analyst - Financial Services Audit - Geneva (October 2027) Deloitte 01.10.2026 100% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz Deloitte Career Start: Analyst - Financial Services Audit - Zurich/Basel (October 2027) Deloitte 01.10.2026 100% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Deloitte Intern - Financial Services Audit - Geneva (October 2027 – March 2028) Deloitte 01.10.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz Deloitte Intern - Financial Services Audit - Zurich/Basel (October 2027 – March 2028) Deloitte 01.10.2026 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Zürich & Schaffhausen Deloitte Career Start: Analyst - Large & Complex Audit - Zurich, Basel & Bern (Start October 2027) (24995) Deloitte 01.10.2026 80% Feststelle - Einstiegsstelle Schweiz Deloitte I